hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2972","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya and Al-Husayn bin Al-Ali Al-Bisṭami, who said: Narrated to us Uthman bin Umar, who narrated to us Yunus, from Az-Zuhri, who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"","" when he threw pebbles at the Jamrah closest to the Masjid of Mina"","" would throw seven pebbles at it"","" saying 'Allahu Akbar' with each pebble. Then he would advance in front of it"","" stand facing the"""""
